Q.19 Consider the following C program: 
#include <stdio.h> 
void stringcopy(char *, char *); 
int main(){ 
char a[30] = "@#Hello World!"; 
stringcopy(a, a + 2); 
printf("%s\n", a); 
return 0; 
} 
void stringcopy(char *s, char *t) { 
while(*t) 
*s++ = *t++; 
}  
Which ONE of the following will be the output of the program?   

(A) @#Hello World! 
(B) Hello World! 
(C) ello World! 
(D) Hello World!d!

